   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY26",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "As we move into Q2 the pipeline of potential new business is strong and gives us a reasonable prospect to generate sufficient new sales orders in H1 to meet market expectations.",
   "file": "20260413_COG_Results-for-the-year-ended-31-December-2025.md"
