   "fy": "FY26",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "2026 has started well and the Company already has visibility over £10m of revenue and continues to trade in line with market expectations* for the year ending 2026 prior to publication of this announcement, with the targeted investments (as described below) significantly increasing the cost base, and therefore losses, over the next two years.",
